   907	/**
   908	 * Delete entity
   909	 * Soft delete by default (sets deleted_at), hard delete with force=true.
   910	 * A hard delete removes the tree + its relationships, deletes/detaches
   911	 * dependent behaviors and feeds, and detaches (never deletes) event rows that
   912	 * reference the tree. `dryRun` returns the dependency report without mutating.
